<p><hi rendition="#aq">III.</hi> Es &#x017F;ey al&#x017F;o z. B. <hi rendition="#aq">y = a x</hi><hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, &#x017F;o i&#x017F;t,<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">x + &#x0394; x</hi> &#x017F;tatt <hi rendition="#aq">x</hi>, und <hi rendition="#aq">y + &#x0394; y</hi> &#x017F;tatt <hi rendition="#aq">y</hi> ge&#x017F;etzt,<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#aq">y + &#x0394; y = a (x + &#x0394; x)</hi><hi rendition="#sup">2</hi></hi><lb/>
Oder <hi rendition="#aq">y + &#x0394; y = a x<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi> + 2 a x . &#x0394; x + a (&#x0394; x)</hi><hi rendition="#sup">2</hi><lb/>
